#: src/guides/feeds/en.mdx:66 src/guides/the-at-stack/en.mdx:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Feed Generator service can host one or more algorithms. The service itself is identified by DID, while each algorithm that it hosts is declared by a record in the repo of the account that created it. For instance, feeds offered by Bluesky will likely be declared in `@bsky.app`'s repo. Therefore, a given algorithm is identified by the at-uri of the declaration record. This declaration record includes a pointer to the service's DID along with some profile information for the feed.\n"
msgstr ""

